  {
    "id": "f66bb33d-8d30-461d-b2a5-4c4165cbda1e",
    "title": "The South Carolina Forum Digital Platform Testing",
    "description": "<p>Dear South Carolina Friends,</p><p>We\u2019re preparing to launch <strong>The South Carolina Forum</strong> in early February\u2014and we\u2019d love your help before we go public.</p><p>We\u2019re using a digital platform called <strong>Go Vocal</strong>, and we\u2019re inviting a small group to join a <strong>60-minute feedback session</strong>. <strong>No pre-work and no prior experience are needed.</strong> Just show up, and we\u2019ll give you a quick tour and ask for your reactions as you try the platform.</p><p>Please choose <strong>one</strong> of the following optional times by scrolling down to register:</p><ul>\n<li>Tuesday, February 3 | 10:00\u201311:00 AM Eastern Standard Time (EST)</li>\n<li>Tuesday, February 3 | 6:30\u20137:30 PM EST</li>\n<li>Wednesday, February 4 | 7:00\u20138:00 PM EST</li>\n</ul><p><strong>How the session will work:</strong></p><ul>\n<li>We\u2019ll meet by video on <strong>Google Meet</strong> (see below). Be sure to download the invitation.</li>\n<li>Please join from a quiet place with a strong internet connection.</li>\n<li>We\u2019ll ask you to interact with and use the platform during the session.</li>\n</ul><p>Thank you in advance\u2014your feedback is critically important to help shape this project.</p><p>With appreciation,</p><p>The South Carolina Forum Team</p>",
    "participation_method": "volunteering",
    "project_id": "68ec36c1-ea99-4d61-b6fb-648fc8dd7295",
    "project_title": "The South Carolina Forum: Pre-launch Digital Testing",
